estine","kjv":"low country, (low) plain, vale(-ley).","count":20},"H8220":{"lemma":"שִׁפְלוּת","xlit":"shiphlûwth","pron":"shif-looth'","from":"from H8213 (שָׁפֵל);","def":"remissness","kjv":"idleness.","count":1},"H8221":{"lemma":"שְׁפָם","xlit":"Shᵉphâm","pron":"shef-awm'","from":"probably from H8192 (שָׁפָה); bare spot;","def":"Shepham, a place in or near Palestine","kjv":"Shepham.","count":2},"H8222":{"lemma":"שָׂפָם","xlit":"sâphâm","pron":"saw-fawm'","from":"from H8193 (שָׂפָה);","def":"the beard (as a lippiece)","kjv":"beard, (upper) lip.","count":5},"H8223":{"lemma":"שָׁפָם","xlit":"Shâphâm","pron":"shaw-fawm'","from":"formed like H8221 (שְׁפָם); baldly;","def":"Shapham, an Israelite","kjv":"Shapham.","count":1},"H8224":{"lemma":"שִׂפְמוֹת","xlit":"Siphmôwth","pron":"sif-moth'","from":"feminine plural of H8221 (שְׁפָם);","def":"Siphmoth, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Siphmoth.","count":1},"H8225":{"lemma":"שִׁפְמִי","xlit":"Shiphmîy","pron":"shif-mee'","from":"patrial from H8221 (שְׁפָם);","def":"a Shiphmite or inhabitant of Shepham","kjv":"Shiphmite.","count":1},"H8226":{"lemma":"שָׂפַן","xlit":"sâphan","pron":"saw-fan'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to conceal (as a valuable)","kjv":"treasure.","count":1},"H8227":{"lemma":"שָׁפָן","xlit":"shâphân","pron":"shaw-fawn'","from":"from H8226 (שָׂפַן);","def":"a species of rockrabbit (from its hiding), i.e. probably the hyrax","kjv":"coney.","count":34},"H8228":{"lemma":"שֶׁפַע","xlit":"shephaʻ","pron":"sheh'-fah","from":"from an unused root meaning to abound;","def":"resources","kjv":"abundance.","count":1},"H8229":{"lemma":"שִׁפְעָה","xlit":"shiphʻâh","pron":"shif-aw'","from":"feminine of H8228 (שֶׁפַע);","def":"copiousness","kjv":"abundance, company, multitude.","count":6},"H8230":{"lemma":"שִׁפְעִי","xlit":"Shiphʻîy","pron":"shif-ee'","from":"from H8228 (שֶׁפַע); copious;","def":"Shiphi, an Israelite","kjv":"Shiphi.","count":1},"H8231":{"lemma":"שָׁפַר","xlit":"shâphar","pron":"shaw-far'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to glisten, i.e. (figuratively) be (causatively, make) fair","kjv":"[idiom] goodly.","count":1},"H8232":{"lemma":"שְׁפַר","xlit":"shᵉphar","pron":"shef-ar'","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8231 (שָׁפַר);","def":"to be beautiful","kjv":"be acceptable, please, [phrase] think good.","count":3},"H8233":{"lemma":"שֶׁפֶר","xlit":"shepher","pron":"sheh'-fer","from":"from H8231 (שָׁפַר);","def":"beauty","kjv":"[idiom] goodly.","count":1},"H8234":{"lemma":"שֶׁפֶר","xlit":"Shepher","pron":"sheh'-fer","from":"the same as H8233 (שֶׁפֶר);","def":"Shepher, a place in the Desert","kjv":"Shapper.","count":2},"H8235":{"lemma":"שִׁפְרָה","xlit":"shiphrâh","pron":"shif-raw'","from":"from H8231 (שָׁפַר);","def":"brightness","kjv":"garnish.","count":1},"H8236":{"lemma":"שִׁפְרָה","xlit":"Shiphrâh","pron":"shif-raw'","from":"the same as H8235 (שִׁפְרָה);","def":"Shiphrah, an Israelitess","kjv":"Shiphrah.","count":1},"H8237":{"lemma":"שַׁפְרוּר","xlit":"shaphrûwr","pron":"shaf-roor'","from":"from H8231 (שָׁפַר);","def":"splendid, i.e. a tapestry or canopy","kjv":"royal pavilion.","count":1},"H8238":{"lemma":"שְׁפַרְפַר","xlit":"shᵉpharphar","pron":"shef-ar-far'","from":"(Aramaic) from H8231 (שָׁפַר);","def":"the dawn (as brilliant with aurora)","kjv":"[idiom] very early in the morning.","count":1},"H8239":{"lemma":"שָׁפַת","xlit":"shâphath","pron":"shaw-fath'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to locate, i.e. (generally) hang on or (figuratively) establish, reduce","kjv":"bring, ordain, set on.","count":5},"H8240":{"lemma":"שָׁפָת","xlit":"shâphâth","pron":"shaw-fawth'","from":"from H8239 (שָׁפַת);","def":"a (double) stall (for cattle); also a (two-pronged) hook (for flaying animals on)","kjv":"hook, pot.","count":2},"H8241":{"lemma":"שֶׁצֶף","xlit":"shetseph","pron":"sheh'-tsef","from":"from H7857 (שָׁטַף) (for alliteration with H7110 (קֶצֶף));","def":"an outburst (of anger)","kjv":"little.","count":1},"H8242":{"lemma":"שַׂק","xlit":"saq","pron":"sak","from":"from H8