ation), detestable (thing).","count":28},"H8252":{"lemma":"שָׁקַט","xlit":"shâqaṭ","pron":"shaw-kat'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to repose (usually figurative)","kjv":"appease, idleness, (at, be at, be in, give) quiet(-ness), (be at, be in, give, have, take) rest, settle, be still.","count":41},"H8253":{"lemma":"שֶׁקֶט","xlit":"sheqeṭ","pron":"sheh'-ket","from":"from H8252 (שָׁקַט);","def":"tranquillity","kjv":"quietness.","count":1},"H8254":{"lemma":"שָׁקַל","xlit":"shâqal","pron":"shaw-kal'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to suspend or poise (especially in trade)","kjv":"pay, receive(-r), spend, [idiom] throughly, weigh.","count":22},"H8255":{"lemma":"שֶׁקֶל","xlit":"sheqel","pron":"sheh'-kel","from":"from H8254 (שָׁקַל);","def":"probably a weight; used as a commercial standard","kjv":"shekel.","count":88},"H8256":{"lemma":"שִׁקְמָה","xlit":"shiqmâh","pron":"shik-maw'","from":"or (feminine) שִׁקְמָה; of uncertain derivation;","def":"a sycamore (usually the tree)","kjv":"sycamore (fruit, tree).","count":7},"H8257":{"lemma":"שָׁקַע","xlit":"shâqaʻ","pron":"shaw-kah'","from":"(abbreviated Amos 8:8); a primitive root;","def":"to subside; by implication, to be overflowed, cease; causatively, to abate, subdue","kjv":"make deep, let down, drown, quench, sink.","count":6},"H8258":{"lemma":"שְׁקַעְרוּרָה","xlit":"shᵉqaʻrûwrâh","pron":"shek-ah-roo-raw'","from":"from H8257 (שָׁקַע);","def":"a depression","kjv":"hollow strake.","count":1},"H8259":{"lemma":"שָׁקַף","xlit":"shâqaph","pron":"shaw-kaf'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"properly, to lean out (of a window), i.e. (by implication) peep or gaze (passively, be a spectacle)","kjv":"appear, look (down, forth, out).","count":22},"H8260":{"lemma":"שֶׁקֶף","xlit":"sheqeph","pron":"sheh'-kef","from":"from H8259 (שָׁקַף);","def":"a loophole (for looking out), to admit light and air","kjv":"window.","count":1},"H8261":{"lemma":"שָׁקֻף","xlit":"shâquph","pron":"shaw-koof'","from":"passive participle of H8259 (שָׁקַף); (compare H8260 (שֶׁקֶף))","def":"an embrasure or opening  with bevelled jam","kjv":"light, window.","count":2},"H8262":{"lemma":"שָׁקַץ","xlit":"shâqats","pron":"shaw-kats'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to be filthy, i.e. (intensively) to loathe, pollute","kjv":"abhor, make abominable, have in abomination, detest, [idiom] utterly.","count":7},"H8263":{"lemma":"שֶׁקֶץ","xlit":"sheqets","pron":"sheh'-kets","from":"from H8262 (שָׁקַץ);","def":"filth, i.e. (figuratively and specifically) an idolatrous object","kjv":"abominable(-tion).","count":11},"H8264":{"lemma":"שָׁקַק","xlit":"shâqaq","pron":"shaw-kak'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to course (like a beast of prey); by implication, to seek greedily","kjv":"have appetite, justle one against another, long, range, run (to and fro).","count":6},"H8265":{"lemma":"שָׂקַר","xlit":"sâqar","pron":"saw-kar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to ogle, i.e. blink coquettishly","kjv":"wanton.","count":1},"H8266":{"lemma":"שָׁקַר","xlit":"shâqar","pron":"shaw-kar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to cheat, i.e. be untrue (usually in words)","kjv":"fail, deal falsely, lie.","count":6},"H8267":{"lemma":"שֶׁקֶר","xlit":"sheqer","pron":"sheh'-ker","from":"from H8266 (שָׁקַר);","def":"an untruth; by implication, a sham (often adverbial)","kjv":"without a cause, deceit(-ful), false(-hood, -ly), feignedly, liar, [phrase] lie, lying, vain (thing), wrongfully.","count":113},"H8268":{"lemma":"שֹׁקֶת","xlit":"shôqeth","pron":"sho'-keth","from":"from H8248 (שָׁקָה);","def":"a trough (for watering)","kjv":"trough.","count":2},"H8269":{"lemma":"שַׂר","xlit":"sar","pron":"sar","from":"from H8323 (שָׂרַר);","def":"a head person (of any rank or class)","kjv":"captain (that had rule), chief (captain), general, governor, keeper, lord,(-task-)master, prince(-ipal), ruler, steward.","count":421},"H8270":{"lemma":"שֹׁר","xlit":"shôr","pron":"shore","from":"from H8324 (שָׁרַר); (compare H8306 (שָׁרִיר))","def":"a string (as twisted ), i.e.